  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Beer battered fries tumble from the fryer in a joyful crunch, each golden fry dusted with herbs and seasoning. Instead of alcohol, a splash of fizzy club soda whips the batter into a light, airy coat that hugs every rustic russet wedge. The result is crispy outsides, fluffy centers, and a pile of irresistible fries begging to be dunked into garlicky aioli or tangy ketchup. Serve these beer battered fries in the center of the table, pass around the dips, and watch them disappear while everyone laughs and reaches for just one more.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-beer-battered-fries\">Why You’ll Love This beer battered fries</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-beer-battered-fries\">How to Make Beer Battered Fries</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-beer-battered-fries\">Pro Tips for Making Beer Battered Fries</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-beer-battered-fries\">How to Serve this beer battered fries</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-beer-battered-fries\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This beer battered fries</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Perfectly crispy on the outside, fluffy on the inside.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Easy to make with simple ingredients you already have.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Great for sharing at parties or enjoying solo.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Customizable with your favorite seasonings and dips.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-7701\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"7701\" data-servings=\"4\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-recip